     kernel configuration file:

           ddeevviiccee aaddbb

DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     The aammss driver provides support for mice and trackpads attached to the
     Apple Desktop Bus (ADB) implementing both the base and extended ADB mouse
     protocols.

HHAARRDDWWAARREE
     Devices supported by the aammss driver include:

     ••   Apple Mouse
     ••   ADB Extended Mouse
     ••   MacAlly 2-Button Mouse
     ••   Apple iBook Trackpad
     ••   Apple PowerBook Trackpad

